ptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>35</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"294\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cB1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>C</mi></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a constant of integration.</p>\n<p>We're told that the tank initially contains <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"295\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>lb</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of salt. So, we can apply the initial condition <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"296\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><m